  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/c2884412449db101109131605691fceb834cf2573aa299fcf37d827760fab117.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là điểm chạm của cây sào vào hai bờ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>L</mi></semantics></math> lần lượt là hình chiếu của điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> lên các cạnh <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.<br>\n\t\tĐặt <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (m), khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tXét hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có bảng biến thiên\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/776dd50da0d3d28ccbf7a74729d6b5e053cd01d3f7ce8ba146fb96170faec93d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>min</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>min</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (m).",
